* NMOS Circuit
M1 4 2 3 3 NMOS    * NMOS Transistor: Drain (4), Gate (2), Source (3)

* Resistors
RD 5 4 RD          * Resistor RD between nodes 5 and 4
RS 3 3 3 RS        * Resistor RS between nodes 3 and ground (node 3)

* Voltage Sources
VDD 5 0 DC         * Voltage source VDD connected between node 5 and ground
VSS 0 3 DC         * Voltage source VSS connected between ground and node 3

* Ground Reference
VREF 2 0 DC 0      * Reference Voltage at gate